# bun.lock is intentionally untracked: Cloudflare Workers Builds pins an
# older Bun (1.2.15) that can't parse the newer lockfileVersion 2 text
# format a current local Bun writes. npm/package-lock.json is the
# CI-authoritative lockfile; bun install still works locally without it.
bun.lock

